{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "ebeb9c98c6cf45e982a500af04b55345",
    "m_Title": "Outline With cross-shaped lines on the floor",
    "m_Content": "Draws glowing outlines on mesh faces and a procedural grid (cross-shaped lines) on the floor.\n\nHow it works:\nA => Edge glow (all faces, UV-based):\r\n1/  GetCoordFromPosition turns each UV axis into a triangle wave (1 at edges, 0 at center).\r\n2/ edgeGradient = max(coord(u), coord(v)) → high near any face border.\r\n3/ Three additive layers build the look:\r\n         - Stroke step(0.99) → sharp line on the edge\r\n         - Glow pow(saturate((edgeGradient − GlowThreshold) × GlowSlop), GlowFallOff) → soft gradient fading inward\r\n         - Base fill + BaseFill → faint constant tint so the center is never fully transparent\r\n\nB => Floor grid (horizontal faces only, world-position-based):\r\n4/ GetCoordFromPosition on world X and Z → two triangle waves; \n5/ Two combined metrics:\r- groundGradient = max(coordX, coordZ) → high along either axis → draws the grid lines (the cross arms).\r\n- gridOffset = min(coordX, coordZ) → high only near intersections.\r\n6/ Grid lines groundGrid = step(0.99, groundGradient) × step(0.8, gridOffset) → sharp cross-shaped lines.\r\n7/ Halo groundGlow = smoothstep(0.8, 0.99, groundGradient) × smoothstep(0.5, 1, gridOffset) → soft glow along the lines.\r\n8/ floorEffect = edgeEffect + _Color × groundGrid + _Color × (groundGlow × 0.25 + 0.2).\n\nC => Angle mask + back face:\r\n9/ groundMask = step(DegreesToRadians(_Angle), acos(abs(dot(normal, up)))) → Arccosine: horizontal faces → 0, walls → π/2.\r\n10/ lerp(floorEffect, edgeEffect, groundMask) → floor gets edges + grid, walls get edges only.\r\n11/ _Color tints everything; the Back Face branch multiplies back-facing pixels by BackFaceThreshold.\n\nTunable properties:\r\n- _Color : overall tint\r\n- GlowThreshold / GlowSlop / GlowFallOff : edge glow width / intensity / softness\r\n- BaseFill — constant face fill (≈ 0.15)\r\n- BackFaceThreshold : back-face dimming (1 = equal, 0.5 = depth cue)\r\n- _Angle : max slope (degrees) that still counts as \"floor\" for the grid",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": 1106.0,
        "y": -326.0,
        "width": 802.0,
        "height": 467.74169921875
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": ""
    }
}

